  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Fund &apos;Accelerating Access Initiative&apos; JFA 0.2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of AAI 2.0 is to support the MoE to ensure that all children in Jordan regardless of nationality &#x2013; including Syrian and non-Syrian refugees, children with disabilities, and out-of-school children &#x2013; have access to a quality education that promotes life-skills, improved learning outcomes, and work readiness. Further, the AAI 2.0 use Jordan&#x2019;s new &#x201C;Education Strategic Plan&#x201D; (ESP) 2018-2022 as strategic framework, which is supported through a combination of off-budget (JFA special account) and on-budget financial aid modalities.</narrative>
  </description>
